        "en": "Enthusiastic and pleasant salon team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the front desk staff and groomers for their warm hospitality and friendly communication. While one reviewer experienced customer service delays during a staff handover, the vast majority of clients praise the team attentive manners and dedication to pet care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Stylish haircuts with occasional variations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most clients praise the salon for neat haircuts, fresh-smelling coats, and tidy nail grinding that leave dogs looking picture-perfect. Nevertheless, a small number of reviewers noted inconsistent cut lengths or residual odours, reflecting minor variations across different groomers."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and loving pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on how happily their dogs greet the grooming staff upon entering the shop. Reviewers appreciate that groomers take time to comfort timid pets with treats, ensuring that grooming sessions remain enjoyable rather than stressful for sensitive canine companions."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Where is this Woof Gang Bakery salon situated?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The shop is located at 1101 Broadway in the historic Pearl district of San Antonio."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are dog bakery goods available alongside grooming?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients love picking up freshly baked dog treats, decorated cookies, and custom pup cakes during visits."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What grooming packages are available at Pearl?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Services range from basic baths and brush-outs to full styling grooms, ear cleanings, and nail buffing."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What should owners do to ensure consistent haircut styling?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers suggest providing clear trimming instructions and rebooking with the same groomer when possible."
      },
